                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It's a good start, but still requires improvement but it's early access so expected. The dev communicates very well though, that's a good thing.\n\nThe game is fun, especially the parachute mechanic, but does slowly become a bore over time. After a few minutes of trying to build something, you realize the UI is pretty un-intuitive and is cumbersome. The textures aren't consistent, sometimes they look crisp, other times the same textures look blurry. The trees do this weird thing where the leaves will move along with your HMD. There's also the whole getting stuck underwater issue, requiring a new game.\n\nOnce goals and a few kinks get worked out, the game will be great.",
